{"title": "SG ScriptedPeaceBehaviour", "pageid": 34981, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour\">List of conditions in SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hag's_Pawn\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hag's Pawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\">Hag's Pawn</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Ethel has taken control. Condition lasts until mask is removed or spellcaster is dead.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Lured\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\">Lured</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity is attracted to a harpy's luring melody and uses its turn to move closer to the harpy, possibly provoking opportunity attacks from the other harpies.</li>\n<li>The affected entity must pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the start of their turn or remain lured.</li>\n<li>Taking damage or being <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a> removes the condition.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220720\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8650/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1717/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 609482/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.757      1 Template:Status_group_page\n100.00%   27.757      1 -total\n 44.17%   12.259      2 Template:Conditions_table/row\n 41.25%   11.450      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 39.66%   11.008      2 Template:Icon_link\n 38.20%   10.604      2 Template:Icon_text\n 36.73%   10.196      5 Template:Trim\n 28.04%    7.782      2 Template:Ifempty\n 17.26%    4.792      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.38%    3.160      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34981-0!canonical and timestamp 2026071